{"id":"level-up-2026-10-30","name":"2026-10-30 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2101","en":"The library displayed a facsimile edition beside the fragile original.","zh":"图书馆在脆弱的原本旁展出了一本影印版。","note":"facsimile · 复制品； 副本 · a facsimile edition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2102","en":"The agreement will stipulate how the shared equipment is maintained.","zh":"协议将明确规定共用设备如何维护。","note":"stipulate · 规定， 明确要求； 讲定， 约定 · stipulate a condition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2103","en":"The plants gradually adapt to the cooler conditions outside.","zh":"这些植物逐渐适应了室外较凉的环境。","note":"adapt · 使适合； 改编； 适应 · adapt to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2104","en":"The baker prepared a fresh batch of rolls before sunrise.","zh":"面包师在日出前新做了一批小面包。","note":"batch · 一批， 一组， 一群； 一批生产量 · a fresh batch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2105","en":"The committee found insufficient evidence to support the proposed explanation.","zh":"委员会发现，支持拟议解释的证据不足。","note":"insufficient · 不足的， 不够的 · insufficient evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2106","en":"A local solicitor visited the college to discuss legal careers.","zh":"一位当地事务律师到学院介绍了法律职业。","note":"solicitor · 法务官； 初级律师， 事务律师 · a local solicitor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2107","en":"The seminar explored the intrinsic value of studying art.","zh":"研讨会探讨了学习艺术本身的价值。","note":"intrinsic · 固有的， 内在的； 本质的 · intrinsic value","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2108","en":"I felt guilty about leaving my colleague with the extra work.","zh":"我把额外工作留给同事，感到内疚。","note":"guilty · 内疚的； 有罪的 · feel guilty","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2109","en":"The flat's close proximity to campus made it especially convenient.","zh":"这套公寓离校园很近，因此格外方便。","note":"proximity · 接近， 邻近； 亲近 · close proximity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2110","en":"The museum specialises in the maritime history of the region.","zh":"这家博物馆专门介绍该地区的海事历史。","note":"maritime · 海的， 海事的； 海运的 · maritime history","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2111","en":"Keep your receipt until you have checked the delivered goods.","zh":"检查好送达的货物之前，请保留收据。","note":"receipt · 收到，接到；发票，收据； · keep a receipt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2112","en":"The study examined emotional arousal during different kinds of music.","zh":"这项研究考察了聆听不同类型音乐时的情绪唤起。","note":"arousal · 唤起， 激起 · emotional arousal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2113","en":"The museum displayed a model of an early space capsule.","zh":"博物馆展出了一座早期太空舱的模型。","note":"capsule · 胶囊； 航天舱， 太空舱 · a space capsule","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2114","en":"Finding a parking space was almost impossible that afternoon.","zh":"那天下午，几乎不可能找到停车位。","note":"impossible · 不可能的， 办不到的 · almost impossible","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2115","en":"Restoring the garden required a joint effort from many neighbours.","zh":"修复花园需要许多邻居共同努力。","note":"effort · 努力， 艰难的尝试； 成就 · a joint effort","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2116","en":"Visitors must not trespass on the farmland beyond the marked path.","zh":"游客不得擅自进入标示小径以外的农田。","note":"trespass · 侵犯； 擅闯； 利用； 冒犯， 触犯 · trespass on land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2117","en":"Her internationalist outlook encouraged cooperation between artists from different countries.","zh":"她的国际主义视野促进了不同国家艺术家之间的合作。","note":"internationalist · 国际主义者的；国际主义者 · an internationalist outlook","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2118","en":"Tourism became a booming industry after the railway opened.","zh":"铁路开通后，旅游业成为一个蓬勃发展的产业。","note":"booming · 发展迅速的； 激增的 · a booming industry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2119","en":"The peaceful surroundings made the hostel ideal for studying.","zh":"周围环境宁静，让这家旅舍成为理想的学习地点。","note":"surroundings · 周围的事物， 环境 · peaceful surroundings","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2120","en":"The project created a shared workshop in an impoverished community.","zh":"项目在一个贫困社区建立了共用工作坊。","note":"impoverished · 穷困的， 赤贫的； 贫乏的， 贫瘠的； 枯竭的 · an impoverished community","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2121","en":"The lesson explained why scientists monitor the ozone layer.","zh":"这堂课解释了科学家为什么要监测臭氧层。","note":"ozone · 臭氧 · the ozone layer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2122","en":"The course introduces students to research on sustainable agriculture.","zh":"这门课程向学生介绍可持续农业研究。","note":"agriculture · 农业； 农学 · sustainable agriculture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2123","en":"The exhibition includes an ancient weapon recovered from the river.","zh":"这个展览包含了一件从河中打捞出的古代武器。","note":"weapon · 武器， 兵器 · an ancient weapon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2124","en":"The repairs were completed with minimal disruption to classes.","zh":"维修完成了，对课堂的干扰降到了最低。","note":"minimal · 最小的， 最低限度的 · minimal disruption","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2125","en":"The photograph shows a lava flow covering the rocky slope.","zh":"照片展示了一股熔岩流覆盖岩石坡面的情景。","note":"lava · 岩浆， 熔岩 · a lava flow","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2126","en":"Her interest in forest ecology began during a school trip.","zh":"她对森林生态学的兴趣始于一次学校旅行。","note":"ecology · 生态， 生态学； 生态环境 · forest ecology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2127","en":"Speaking openly about the failed project was a courageous decision.","zh":"公开谈论失败的项目，是一个勇敢的决定。","note":"courageous · 勇敢的， 有胆量的 · a courageous decision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2128","en":"The guide showed us photographs of a venomous snake.","zh":"导游给我们看了一种毒蛇的照片。","note":"venomous · 有毒的； 分泌毒液的； 恶意的， 狠毒的 · a venomous snake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2129","en":"The factory tour included a demonstration of plastic extrusion.","zh":"工厂参观包括一场塑料挤出工艺的演示。","note":"extrusion · 挤出， 推出， 挤压 · plastic extrusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2130","en":"The restoration team made steady progress throughout the winter.","zh":"修复团队在整个冬季都在稳步推进工作。","note":"steady · 稳步的；稳定的；稳定， 平稳； 镇定 · steady progress","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2131","en":"Students used inductive reasoning to suggest a pattern in the observations.","zh":"学生用归纳推理提出了一种观察结果中的规律。","note":"inductive reasoning · [计][数] 归纳推理；归纳法 · inductive reasoning","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2132","en":"Please enclose a copy of your receipt with the letter.","zh":"请随信附上一份收据复印件。","note":"enclose · 围住； 附上； 把…装入信封 · enclose a document","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2133","en":"The introduction provides a brief overview of the research project.","zh":"引言简要概述了这个研究项目。","note":"overview · 综览， 概述 · a brief overview","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2134","en":"The headmaster welcomed new pupils at the morning assembly.","zh":"校长在晨会上欢迎了新入学的学生。","note":"headmaster · 校长 · the school headmaster","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2135","en":"A skilled technician repaired the damaged projector before the lecture.","zh":"一位熟练的技术人员在讲座前修好了损坏的投影仪。","note":"technician · 技术员， 技师 · a skilled technician","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2136","en":"A stone sundial stands in the centre of the garden.","zh":"花园中央立着一座石制日晷。","note":"sundial · 日规； 日晷 · a stone sundial","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2137","en":"The boxes carried generic labels that gave little useful information.","zh":"这些箱子上贴着笼统的标签，几乎没有有用信息。","note":"generic · 一般的， 普通的， 通用的； 种的， 属的 · a generic label","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2138","en":"The café replaced disposable cups with reusable ceramic mugs.","zh":"这家咖啡馆用可重复使用的陶瓷杯替换了一次性杯子。","note":"disposable · 一次性的； 可动用的 · disposable cups","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2139","en":"The committee voted to endorse the proposal for a new playground.","zh":"委员会投票赞同修建新游乐场的提案。","note":"endorse · 支持， 赞同 · endorse a proposal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2140","en":"Shorter sentences gave the final report greater clarity.","zh":"更短的句子让最终报告更加清楚。","note":"clarity · 清楚 · greater clarity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2141","en":"Better transport infrastructure could connect the village with nearby towns.","zh":"更好的交通基础设施可以把村庄与附近城镇连接起来。","note":"infrastructure · 基础结构， 基础设施 · transport infrastructure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2142","en":"The writer would seclude herself in the cabin to finish chapters.","zh":"这位作家会独自待在小屋里，完成书稿章节。","note":"seclude · 使隔离， 使孤立 · seclude oneself","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2143","en":"This cottage is a typical example of local stone construction.","zh":"这间小屋是当地石砌建筑的典型例子。","note":"typical · 典型的 · a typical example","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2144","en":"The camera recorded several nocturnal animals moving through the garden.","zh":"相机记录下几种夜行动物穿过花园的画面。","note":"nocturnal · 夜晚的； 夜晚发生的； 夜晚活动的 · nocturnal animals","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2145","en":"The old printer was notorious for jamming during important deadlines.","zh":"那台旧打印机出了名地总在重要截止期限前卡纸。","note":"notorious · 著名的， 众所周知的； 声名狼藉的 · notorious for","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2146","en":"The confusing booking system caused unnecessary aggravation for visitors.","zh":"复杂混乱的预订系统给访客带来了不必要的烦恼。","note":"aggravation · 加重； 恶化； 愤怒， 恼怒 · unnecessary aggravation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2147","en":"The coastline is continually changing as waves move the sand.","zh":"随着海浪推动沙子，海岸线不断变化。","note":"continually · 连续地， 持续地 · continually changing","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2148","en":"We helped unload the van before arranging the exhibition materials.","zh":"布置展览材料之前，我们帮忙卸了货车。","note":"unload · 从…卸下货物； 摆脱 · unload a van","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2149","en":"A travelling circus set up its tents beside the river.","zh":"一个巡回马戏团在河边搭起了帐篷。","note":"circus · 马戏团； 环形广场 · a travelling circus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:s2150","en":"A camera trap captured images of foxes visiting the garden.","zh":"一台自动感应相机拍下了狐狸来到花园的画面。","note":"trap · 陷阱，圈套，诡计；诱捕， 诱骗， 使中圈套； 使陷入困境， 使受限制 · a camera trap","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:w2101","en":"facsimile","zh":"复制品； 副本","note":"英 /fæk'sɪməli/ · 美 /fæk'sɪməli/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2101-uk-c2933bbd936c.mp3","text":"facsimile"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2101-us-1b432cd58d42.mp3","text":"facsimile"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:w2102","en":"stipulate","zh":"规定， 明确要求； 讲定， 约定","note":"英 /'stɪpjʊleɪt/ · 美 /'stɪpjulet/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2102-uk-976f2b2ff22d.mp3","text":"stipulate"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2102-us-a0b96a6ee432.mp3","text":"stipulate"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-30:w2103","en":"adapt","zh":"使适合； 改编； 适应","note":"英 /ə'dæpt/ · 美 /ə'dæpt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2103